::SQL Set Operators::
The INTERSECT operator is used to get the _______ tuples.
{
    =Common
    ~Different
    ~All
    ~Repetitive
}

::SQL Set Operators::
The UNION operation automatically ______ unlike the select clause.
{
    ~Adds common tuples
    =Eliminates duplicate
    ~Eliminates unique tuples
    ~Adds tuples
}

::SQL Set Operators::
If we retain all duplicates, we must makes use of _______ instead of UNION.
{
    ~INTERSECT ALL
    =UNION ALL
    ~UNION INTERSECT
    ~INTERSECT UNION
}
